                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "4.5/10\nheads up the can back out of the screen right after hitting the ball to start running to where the ball is going to land, MASSIVE ADVANTAGE!!! the bots dont do it\n+ you can play as the 12 foot home depot skeleton\n- no tutorial what so ever just GOOOO it takes a minute to figure it out how to play until the next campaign where its almost a fully new golf system and were back to trail and error\n- cant remap keys\n+ art style\n- voice acting is awkward\n- sometimes you cant see shit behind the robots when trying to hit\nwould get on sale\n- ive used an ability 9+ times and still have no idea what it does\n- my ball got stuck under a building\n- once you lock in the direction your going to hit the ball you cant change anything or back out of it",
